    "Canopies (กันสาด) along both long walls: B9 cantilevers 2.00 out from every column line (1-10) to the edge beam B7, slab S1 in each bay, B8 along the wall rows A and E. A third canopy (มุข) projects from the right end wall (grid 10) between rows B and D: B8 1.00 inside grid 10 (line 9'), B7 2.00 outside (line 10'), B9 on rows B, C and D, four S1 panels — chain 1.00 | 2.00 and 3.50 | 3.50.",
